WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.120
A few years ago, I remember hearing about the carbon footprint, and then President Obama

00:06.120 --> 00:13.160
would get into Air Force One, a massive Boeing 747, and not a new one, an old one with old

00:13.160 --> 00:17.720
engines that spew everything into the atmosphere.

00:17.720 --> 00:22.140
He'd talk about the carbon footprint, we must do something, then he'd get in and he'd fly

00:22.140 --> 00:25.380
from Washington to Hawaii to play a round of golf.

